## Scope

### In Scope

- Public energy data
- Public weather data
- Synthetic customer data
- Data engineering
- BI data modeling
- KPI governance
- Data quality
- Dashboard development
- AI-assisted BI
- Optional advanced analytics

### Out of Scope

- Proprietary employer data
- Customer personally identifiable information
- Real-world trading decisions
- Real-world retail pricing decisions
- Grid control
- Power plant operations
- Transmission optimization

---

## Success Criteria

The first major version will be considered successful when it contains:

- A reproducible data pipeline
- A documented analytical data model
- A governed KPI framework
- A data quality monitoring framework
- At least one complete BI dashboard
- AI-assisted BI functionality
- Reproducible documentation
- Public GitHub repository
